msgstr "日"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1027
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:348
msgid ""
"The maximum number of days in advance that reservations can be made. Set to "
"0 for no limit."
msgstr ""
"本日から何日先までの予約を受付可能かを指定する事ができます。0の場合は無制限"
"（シフト登録のある日時）となります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1037
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:316
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:738
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:877
msgid "Reservation status"
msgstr "予約ステータス"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1045
msgid "Instant confirmation"
msgstr "即時確定"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1048
msgid "Make a tentative reservation"
msgstr "仮予約にする"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1052
msgid ""
"For tentative reservations, a reservation confirmation email will be sent to "
"the user even when the reservation is changed to confirmed."
msgstr ""
"仮予約の場合、確定に変更された時点でもユーザーに予約確定メールが送信されま"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1053
msgid ""
"*Reservations made by users with administrator privileges and salon "
"privileges will be confirmed immediately."
msgstr ""
"※ 管理者権限及びサロン側の権限を持つユーザーによる予約の場合は即時確定になり"
"ます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1060
msgid "Reservation cancellation"
msgstr "予約キャンセル"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1064
