msgstr "ユーザーによるウェブからの予約キャンセル"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1071
msgid "time specification"
msgstr "時間指定"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1074
msgid "Cannot be canceled"
msgstr "キャンセル不可"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1091
msgid "until the hour"
msgstr "時間前まで"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1097
msgid "Duplicate reservations for the same staff"
msgstr "同一スタッフの予約重複"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1107
msgid "Permitted only if specified from the management screen"
msgstr "管理画面からの指定の場合に限り許可"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1110
msgid ""
"Duplicate reservations for the same staff member in the same time slot will "
"only be permitted if manually specified by the staff member from the "
"management screen."
msgstr ""
"同一スタッフの同じ時間帯での重複予約について、管理画面からスタッフによる手動"
"指定の場合に限って許可します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1119
#: src/admin/class-setup-notices.php:234
msgid "Representative email address"
msgstr "代表メールアドレス"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1129
